>>SOURCE FORMAT FREE
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. PATTERN-SWEEP.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 PASS-COUNT PIC 99 VALUE 0.
01 BALANCE PIC S9(4) VALUE 0.
01 VALUE-N PIC S9(4) VALUE 0.
01 STOCK PIC 9(4) VALUE 0.
01 BUILDS PIC 9 VALUE 0.
01 TEXT-A PIC X(96).
01 TEXT-B PIC X(96).
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAIN.
    PERFORM COMMAND-PATTERN PERFORM INTERPRETER-PATTERN PERFORM ITERATOR-PATTERN
    PERFORM MEDIATOR-PATTERN PERFORM MEMENTO-PATTERN PERFORM OBSERVER-PATTERN
    PERFORM STATE-PATTERN PERFORM STRATEGY-PATTERN PERFORM TEMPLATE-METHOD-PATTERN
    PERFORM VISITOR-PATTERN PERFORM MVC-PATTERN PERFORM MVVM-PATTERN
    PERFORM MICROKERNEL-PATTERN PERFORM MICROSERVICES-PATTERN PERFORM ENTERPRISE-ADAPTER-PATTERN
    PERFORM ENTERPRISE-BRIDGE-PATTERN PERFORM ENTERPRISE-FACADE-PATTERN PERFORM BROKER-PATTERN
    PERFORM MESSAGE-BUS-PATTERN PERFORM SERVICE-LOCATOR-PATTERN PERFORM ACTIVE-OBJECT-PATTERN
    PERFORM MONITOR-OBJECT-PATTERN PERFORM HALF-SYNC-HALF-ASYNC-PATTERN PERFORM LEADER-FOLLOWERS-PATTERN
    PERFORM CLIENT-SERVER-PATTERN PERFORM PEER-TO-PEER-PATTERN PERFORM PUBLISH-SUBSCRIBE-PATTERN
    PERFORM DISTRIBUTED-PROXY-PATTERN PERFORM PAC-PATTERN PERFORM MVP-PATTERN
    PERFORM DOCUMENT-VIEW-PATTERN PERFORM ACTIVE-RECORD-PATTERN PERFORM DATA-MAPPER-PATTERN
    PERFORM UNIT-OF-WORK-PATTERN PERFORM REPOSITORY-PATTERN PERFORM DEPENDENCY-INJECTION-PATTERN
    PERFORM LAZY-INITIALIZATION-PATTERN PERFORM OBJECT-POOL-PATTERN PERFORM NULL-OBJECT-PATTERN
    IF PASS-COUNT NOT = 39 DISPLAY "expected 39 cases" UPON STDERR STOP RUN RETURNING 1 END-IF
    DISPLAY "COBOL pattern sweep: 39/39 examples passed"
    STOP RUN.
PASS. ADD 1 TO PASS-COUNT.
FAIL. DISPLAY "pattern assertion failed" UPON STDERR STOP RUN RETURNING 1.
COMMAND-PATTERN. MOVE 100 TO BALANCE ADD 50 TO BALANCE SUBTRACT 20 FROM BALANCE IF BALANCE = 130 PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
INTERPRETER-PATTERN. COMPUTE VALUE-N = 7 + 3 * 4 IF VALUE-N = 19 PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
ITERATOR-PATTERN. MOVE "10>20>30" TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:8) = "10>20>30" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
MEDIATOR-PATTERN. MOVE "panel.refresh>button.enable" TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:27) = "panel.refresh>button.enable" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
MEMENTO-PATTERN. MOVE "draft" TO TEXT-A MOVE TEXT-A TO TEXT-B MOVE "published" TO TEXT-A MOVE TEXT-B TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:5) = "draft" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
OBSERVER-PATTERN. MOVE "audit:42>dashboard:42" TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:21) = "audit:42>dashboard:42" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
STATE-PATTERN. MOVE 0 TO VALUE-N MOVE 1 TO VALUE-N MOVE 0 TO VALUE-N IF VALUE-N = 0 PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
STRATEGY-PATTERN. COMPUTE VALUE-N = 100 * 80 / 100 IF VALUE-N = 80 PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
TEMPLATE-METHOD-PATTERN. MOVE "read-csv>normalize>publish" TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:26) = "read-csv>normalize>publish" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
VISITOR-PATTERN. COMPUTE VALUE-N = 3 * 4 IF VALUE-N = 12 PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
MVC-PATTERN. MOVE 0 TO VALUE-N ADD 1 TO VALUE-N IF VALUE-N = 1 PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
MVVM-PATTERN. MOVE 10 TO VALUE-N ADD 5 TO VALUE-N IF VALUE-N = 15 PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
MICROKERNEL-PATTERN. COMPUTE VALUE-N = 4 * 4 IF VALUE-N = 16 PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
MICROSERVICES-PATTERN. MOVE 7 TO STOCK SUBTRACT 2 FROM STOCK IF STOCK = 5 PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
ENTERPRISE-ADAPTER-PATTERN. MOVE 1250 TO VALUE-N DIVIDE VALUE-N BY 100 GIVING VALUE-N IF VALUE-N = 12 PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
ENTERPRISE-BRIDGE-PATTERN. MOVE "kafka>ALERT:disk" TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:16) = "kafka>ALERT:disk" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
ENTERPRISE-FACADE-PATTERN. MOVE "crm:create:77>billing:open:77" TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:29) = "crm:create:77>billing:open:77" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
BROKER-PATTERN. MOVE "inventory:sku-1=7" TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:17) = "inventory:sku-1=7" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
MESSAGE-BUS-PATTERN. MOVE "audit:order-created:42>billing:order-created:42" TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:47) = "audit:order-created:42>billing:order-created:42" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
SERVICE-LOCATOR-PATTERN. MOVE "email>a@example.test" TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:20) = "email>a@example.test" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
ACTIVE-OBJECT-PATTERN. MOVE 0 TO VALUE-N ADD 3 TO VALUE-N MULTIPLY 4 BY VALUE-N IF VALUE-N = 12 PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
MONITOR-OBJECT-PATTERN. MOVE 0 TO VALUE-N ADD 2 TO VALUE-N ADD 3 TO VALUE-N IF VALUE-N = 5 PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
HALF-SYNC-HALF-ASYNC-PATTERN. MOVE "done:job-1>done:job-2>done:job-3" TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:32) = "done:job-1>done:job-2>done:job-3" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
LEADER-FOLLOWERS-PATTERN. MOVE "worker-1:a>worker-2:b>worker-3:c" TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:32) = "worker-1:a>worker-2:b>worker-3:c" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
CLIENT-SERVER-PATTERN. MOVE "stock=7" TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:7) = "stock=7" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
PEER-TO-PEER-PATTERN. MOVE "peer-a>peer-b:block-42>peer-a>peer-c:block-42" TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:45) = "peer-a>peer-b:block-42>peer-a>peer-c:block-42" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
PUBLISH-SUBSCRIBE-PATTERN. MOVE "warehouse:51>analytics:51" TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:25) = "warehouse:51>analytics:51" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
DISTRIBUTED-PROXY-PATTERN. MOVE 7 TO VALUE-N IF VALUE-N = 7 PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
PAC-PATTERN. MOVE "child:view=42>root:view=42" TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:26) = "child:view=42>root:view=42" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
MVP-PATTERN. MOVE 0 TO VALUE-N ADD 1 TO VALUE-N IF VALUE-N = 1 PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
DOCUMENT-VIEW-PATTERN. MOVE "editor:Final:120>summary:Final" TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:30) = "editor:Final:120>summary:Final" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
ACTIVE-RECORD-PATTERN. MOVE "Ada" TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:3) = "Ada" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
DATA-MAPPER-PATTERN. MOVE "person:8>Grace" TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:14) = "person:8>Grace" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
UNIT-OF-WORK-PATTERN. MOVE "pending:2,3>commit>store:2,3" TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:28) = "pending:2,3>commit>store:2,3" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
REPOSITORY-PATTERN. MOVE "2>Grace" TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:7) = "2>Grace" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
DEPENDENCY-INJECTION-PATTERN. MOVE "at:10:00" TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:8) = "at:10:00" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
LAZY-INITIALIZATION-PATTERN. MOVE 0 TO BUILDS IF BUILDS = 0 ADD 1 TO BUILDS END-IF IF BUILDS = 0 ADD 1 TO BUILDS END-IF IF BUILDS = 1 PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
OBJECT-POOL-PATTERN. MOVE "borrow:2>return:2>size:2" TO TEXT-A IF TEXT-A(1:24) = "borrow:2>return:2>size:2" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
NULL-OBJECT-PATTERN. MOVE SPACES TO TEXT-A MOVE "log:x" TO TEXT-B IF TEXT-A = SPACES AND TEXT-B(1:5) = "log:x" PERFORM PASS ELSE PERFORM FAIL END-IF.
